We have a long (658 packages) that do not have any developer associated
to them in the DEVELOPERS file. But I'm sure some of those packages are
in active use by several Buildroot contributors/developers/users.

So, if you're interested in helping to maintain one of the following
packages, could you send a patch adding yourself to the DEVELOPERS file
for this package?

Thanks for your help!

Thomas

